gine/godot/pull/103922#issuecomment-2741493301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103922","id":2741493301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jZ941","user":{"login":"Jesusemora","id":32273722,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjczNzIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32273722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora","html_url":"https://github.com/Jesusemora","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jesusemora/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-20T19:40:38Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T19:40:38Z","body":"> Window needs the same changes.\r\n\r\ndone.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n> Changing Control's `theme` should update property list, because the variations require re-selecting the node to appear. Also if you assign a theme, it will override the variation list from project's/default theme. The lists should be merged instead.\r\n> \r\n> I think the fix is fine overall. Ideally the Control should fetch variations from all Themes in parent Control nodes (so e.g. if you have 3 nested Controls, each with a theme, the variations should be fetched and combined from all themes). **That** could be performance-intensive though, so your solution, while it's not complete, is better than the current state.\r\n> \r\n> EDIT: For the property list update, you can use NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED.\r\n\r\nt